#: forms.py:174 models.py:104
msgid "Recaptcha configuration parameters"
msgstr "ReCaptcha-Konfiguration"

#: forms.py:177 models.py:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The reCAPTCHA widget supports several <a href=\"{attr_link}\" "
"target=\"_blank\">data attributes</a> that customize the behaviour of the "
"widget, such as <code>data-theme</code>, <code>data-size</code>. The "
"reCAPTCHA api supports several <a href=\"{api_link}\" "
"target=\"_blank\">parameters</a>. Add these api parameters as attributes, "
"e.g. <code>hl</code> to set the language."
msgstr ""
"Das reCAPTCHA-Feld unterstüzt mehrere <a href=\"{attr_link}\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Datenattribute</a>, die das Verhalten des Feldes anpassen, "
"wie z.B. <code>data-theme</code>, <code>data-size</code>. Die reCAPTCHA API "
"unterstützt mehrere <a href=\"{api_link}\" target=\"_blank\">Parameter</a>. "
"Dies API-Parameter als Attribute hinzufügen, z.B. <code>hl</code> um die "
"Sprache einzustellen."

#: forms.py:213
msgid "Please provide a form name to be able to evaluate form submissions."
msgstr ""
"Bitte einen eindeutigen Formularnamen angeben, um die Formulare auswerten zu "
"können."

#: forms.py:228
msgid "Please select \"Save form submission\" to allow users to reopen forms."
msgstr ""
"Bitte \"Formulareinsendungen speichern\" wählen, damit Nutzer Formulare "
"wieder öffnen können."

#: forms.py:231
msgid ""
"Please select the action \"Save form submission\" to allow users to reopen "
